        <mxCell id="card_s2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" value="&lt;div style=&#39;padding:6px 10px;font-family:Inter,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;&#39;&gt;  &lt;div style=&#39;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:4px;&#39;&gt;    &lt;span style=&#39;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0F172A;letter-spacing:-0.2px;&#39;&gt;Multi-Source Semantic Vector Retrieval&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span style=&#39;background-color:#4F46E51A;color:#4F46E5;border:1px solid #4F46E54D;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;&#39;&gt;STAGE 2&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div style=&#39;height:1px;background-color:#E2E8F0;margin:3px 0 6px 0;&#39;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div style=&#39;font-size:10.5px;color:#334155;line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:2px;&#39;&gt;• Encodes query claim into R^384 vector via MiniLM-L6 (CPU)&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div style=&#39;font-size:10.5px;color:#334155;line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:2px;&#39;&gt;• Executes FAISS inner product search for exact cosine similarity&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div style=&#39;font-size:10.5px;color:#334155;line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:2px;&#39;&gt;• Retrieves top-k candidate passages (&lt;i&gt;k = 3&lt;/i&gt;, threshold &lt;i&gt;τ_sim ≥ 0.25&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div style=&#39;font-size:10.5px;color:#334155;line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:2px;&#39;&gt;• Zero matches trigger fallback reason: &lt;i&gt;NO_EVIDENCE_RETRIEVED&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
